1
00:00:00,535 --> 00:00:01,775
(Sheldon:)Are you sure?

2
00:00:03,605 --> 00:00:05,415
(Sheldon:)Every time my dad stayed out
all night,

3
00:00:05,440 --> 00:00:08,080
(Sheldon:)my mom would put hamster poop
in his chewing tobacco.

4
00:00:10,579 --> 00:00:12,179
(Amy:)Well, that's not how
we're going to do it.

5
00:00:12,781 --> 00:00:14,261
(Leonard:)Fine.

6
00:00:14,349 --> 00:00:15,849
(Sheldon:)I'm mad at you.

7
00:00:15,918 --> 00:00:18,298
(Sheldon:)Not only did you ruin Raiders for me,

8
00:00:18,353 --> 00:00:20,193
(Sheldon:)you may have ruined
the whole franchise.

9
00:00:20,255 --> 00:00:22,095
(Sheldon:)Except for the fourth one,

10
00:00:22,124 --> 00:00:24,264
(Sheldon:)which was bad
before you got your mitts on it.

11
00:00:26,128 --> 00:00:28,408
(Amy:)I shouldn't have said it.
I'm sorry.

12
00:00:29,064 --> 00:00:30,374
(Sheldon:)Thank you.

13
00:00:30,432 --> 00:00:32,912
(Amy:)-Do you feel better?
-Yes.

14
00:00:33,402 --> 00:00:35,242
(Sheldon:)But not as good as I'm going
to when I tell you

15
00:00:35,304 --> 00:00:38,214
(Sheldon:)that your precious Garfield has
no reason to hate Mondays.

16
00:00:39,308 --> 00:00:41,418
(Sheldon:)He's a cat.
He doesn't have a job.

17
00:00:47,082 --> 00:00:49,562
(Leonard:)Hey, I was just--
What is happening?

18
00:00:51,420 --> 00:00:53,090
(Penny:)Oh, just a little treat.

19
00:00:53,155 --> 00:00:55,935
(Penny:)I know you've been feeling really bad
about your mom lately.

20
00:00:55,991 --> 00:00:59,271
(Leonard:)Oh, oh, I have. So bad.

